mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[New fact or load] --> Q1{Does an object already own this fact?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| Norm[Keep it there: normalize]
  Q1 -->|No| Schema[New field or object]
  Schema --> Q2{Is this a copy for convenience?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Den[Denormalize only with a named writer]
  Q2 -->|No| Rel[Relationship or junction]
  Rel --> Q3{Will one parent or owner exceed about 10000?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Dist[Distribute owners or parents; no dummy pile]
  Q3 -->|No| Ok[Proceed and remeasure]
